* A .-label symbol (dot-less-vsect) used in its own source: r68 relocates that use negated (the
* counter less the label's address), which ELF can't express: an error naming it.
* fixed: pending
* expect error: Size (.-a vsect label) used in its own source
 org 0
Rec_A do.l 1
Rec_B do.w 3
 psect dot_less_vsect_use,0,0,0,0,0
 vsect
Pad ds.w 1
First: ds.l 1
Second ds.w 1
Size: equ .-First
 ends
 move.w #Size-1,d1
 ends
